  "description": "Built-in gate presets are defined in Rust and can change without a maintained documentation surface. Add a deterministic projection that distinguishes shipped presets from project-local registries.\n\nSource: `crates/jit/src/gate_presets/builtin.rs:1-6,43-117,313-372`; `crates/jit/src/gate_presets/manager.rs:27-44,111-137`; `crates/jit/src/commands/invariant.rs:1-23`; `crates/jit/src/commands/reference.rs:1-19`.\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- [hard] REQ-01: A deterministic discoverable projection renders every built-in preset with gate keys, stages, modes, descriptions, and relevant checker metadata.\n- [hard] REQ-02: The rendered surface distinguishes shipped presets from project-local/custom configuration.\n- [hard] REQ-03: Freshness coverage fails when a built-in preset or gate definition changes without regeneration.",
